\frac{1+\sum\limits_{k=1}^{\infty}\frac{(k+1)^2}{k!}D^{k} f(0)(z_0^k)\zeta^k}{1+\sum\limits_{k=1}^{\infty}\frac{k+1}{k!}D^k f(0)(z_0^k)\zeta^k}.
