-\frac{(1 + 10\alpha + 13\alpha^2)p_1^4}{12(1 + \alpha)^3(1 + 2\alpha)^2(1 + 3\alpha)} + \frac{\alpha p_1^2 p_2}{2(1 + \alpha)(1 + 2\alpha)^2(1 + 3\alpha)} - \frac{p_2^2}{4(1 + 2\alpha)^2}\\& + \frac{p_1 p_3}{3(1 + \alpha)(1 + 3\alpha)}.
