\label{Th-32}Let $f\in\mathcal{H}(\mathbb{B},\mathbb{C})$ with $f(0)=1$ and $F(z)=zf(z)\in\mathcal{S}(\mathbb{B})$, $\alpha\in\mathbb{R}$ and $0\leq \beta\leq 1$. If
