By the given condition, we have $F\in\mathcal{M}_{\alpha}(\mathbb{B})$ and so \eqref{Lem1.1} holds. Let $z\in \mathbb{B}\backslash\{0\}$ be fixed and let $z_0=z/\|z\|$.
